n long flights, and whether his lack of motivation for further education could limit adaptation to evolving technology.\n**What would change my vote:** Convincing evidence that C\u2019s communication problems lead to critical misunderstandings in flight operations, or stronger evidence that B\u2019s uncooperativeness consistently disrupts crew performance, would shift my preference toward another candidate.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_2\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
